  "_comment": "PAPER EQUIPMENT — the vanilla reference ladder for docs/equipment-balance-design.md Part 8. Each entry is a plain item: the wearer's own basic item (or an empty accessory slot) plus ONE effect of the given magnitude, no flavour. Measured by bin/reference-set.js on blank-slate archetypes (ruleset Part 6g) against neutral rulebook encounters. A ladder of magnitudes per effect, not one item per rarity: some effects are lumpy (+1 accuracy is already priced near a Rare), so the price CURVE is what gets measured and the rarity fit is read off it.",
